{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest is a multiplayer first-person shooter with an emphasis on realism. This game has a minimum of casual aspects, you won't see the usual crosshair in the center of the screen, health and ammo counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710750/extras/GamePlay2.00_00_56_30.Still001.png?t=1746825884\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Everything is done so that the immersion is maximum  <br>  <br>Artificial intelligence is made at a high level, similar to FEAR, bots hear your movement and react to shooting in their direction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710750/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_30_10.Still005.png?t=1746825884\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two maps have been added to diversify the battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710750/extras/05.png?t=1746825884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hear bullets whistling over your head, you see smoke coming out of the barrel, which can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710750/extras/GamePlay2.00_01_12_02.Still004.png?t=1746825884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several funny mechanics have also been added, which you will see directly by playing this game</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FIRST BLOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710750/a21352bed6813d490f6ee23a9dadee45748b15b4.jpg"},{"name":"NOT BAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710750/e1ac7094c5b738e8cbc622661647da154d073989.jpg"},{"name":"OH...BOY","path":"https://cdn.